Resolutions
19. Consideration of a resolution giving public notice of Laramie County's
intent to adopt the 2024 International Code Council Building Codes.
24 - 486
Resolution, 2024 International Code Council Building
Codes
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said the county is adopting the updated international building
codes and starting the 45-day comment period. Arnold noted the department will
reach out to local contractors and stakeholders to facilitate an open house on Nov 20.
Commissioner Holmes said he would vote no on this item because he does not like
the way the International Building Code Council forces the county to buy a new book
every three years, and he is not sure if the upgrades are doing anything to protect
public health.
A motion was made by Vice Chairman Malm, seconded by Commissioner
Thompson, that this agenda item be approved. The motion carried by the
following vote:
Lovett, Malm, Heath, Thompson
Aye:
Holmes
Nay:
Land Use:Variances/Board App./Plats
